{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-harbour-lights","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"harbour-lights","about":"Damac Properties’ Harbour Lights, where luxury takes centre stage. Immerse yourself in a world of entrancing allure, inspired by the sea’s enticing waves and mesmerising beauty. Prepare to be taken in by the sheer elegance and sophistication of this 52-story marvel, which features precisely constructed 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments along the magnificent waterfront. Indulge in a lifestyle reminiscent of a luxurious cruise ship. From the enormous, cabin-like rooms to the sprawling, resort-style swimming pools, every interior detail and facility symbolises the pinnacle of magnificence. At Harbour Lights by Damac, you’ll find yourself in a luxurious and exclusive environment where every detail radiates richness.Enter a world where high-end luxury meets flawless fashion. The famous brand de Grisogono incorporates its unique style throughout the property’s common areas, resulting in a smooth flow of intriguing features that delicately guide you through this refuge of elegance. As you experience the mesmerising attractions of Harbour Lights by Damac Properties, prepare to be transported to a realm of unparalleled luxury. Discover a residential paradise where exclusivity meets sophistication, and let the harmonic blend of design and ambiance to leave an indelible mark on your senses. Set out on this remarkable journey to discover the pinnacle of luxury living.","price":2600000,"title":"Harbour Lights","bitrix":{"id":17,"pf_id":"are.2.12405","source":null,"project_id":"Harbour Lights","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Harbour Lights","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"Maritime City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/harbour_lights_feature_31d96af326.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cl